  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.5.0 — AddPqFileEncryption and AddPqHybridFileEncryption gain overloads taking a PqDecryptionLimits, so hosts that decrypt containers from untrusted sources can register capped decryptors in one line. Tracks the family in lockstep; no change to the .pqfe v2 container format, which remains FROZEN for the 1.x line. See CHANGELOG.md.",
